- Documents of the user, listed down the left edge of the editor: which one is
- open, its name, a new one. A list and not a picker, because a scene is a place
- a person moves between while working and not a setting they change now and then.
- Owns no data. The store is handed in by the app so that the whole editor holds
- one, and every value shown here is read from it and written back into it.
$bog_vmap_app_scenes $mol_view
	store $bog_vmap_app_store
	- Link of the open document, empty when there is none yet. Two way: picking
	- one writes the address, and the address is what the store reads.
	current? \
	title? \
	- Whether there is a document to name at all. The field is off without one,
	- so that a name typed into an empty editor does not grab a land per keystroke.
	current_exists false
	sub /
		<= Head $mol_view
			sub /
				\Сцены
		<= List $mol_list
			rows <= scene_rows /
		<= Title $mol_string
			hint \Название сцены
			enabled <= current_exists
			value? <=> title?
		<= Add $mol_button_minor
			title \Новая сцена
			hint \Завести новый документ. Он станет текущим
			click? <=> add? null
	-
	- One row per document. The row of the palette, because a scene row is the same
	- thing: a line of text that is either the current one or not.
	Scene_row* $bog_vmap_app_palette_item
		title <= scene_title* \
		hint <= scene_title* \
		current <= scene_current* false
		click? <=> scene_click*? null
